I'm '''Ellie'''! I actively organize VRChat events and contribute to communities across VRChat. My work focuses on bringing people together in VR spaces and supporting social VR activities.

== VRChat & Community Events ==
Events are at the heart of what I do. I organize and host gatherings in VRChat to bring people together, foster inclusive spaces, and help players connect across different communities. Running meetup/hangout instances, coordinating social activities, and helping manage group events, I focus on building welcoming environments where everyone can socialize, share creative work, and participate in events and the broad DJ and Rave scene in VRChat.


== Community Involvement ==
I regularly participate in broader VR group spaces, local user networks, and online creator hubs to support new members, share technical knowledge, and collaborate on group activities across platforms like VRChat

== Contact ==
If you want to collaborate on a VRChat event, discuss community projects, or get in touch, reach out to me through my [https://x.com/ellieautism X (Twitter)] or connect via my [https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_37fd83cd-90e1-43cc-a51b-96c43a769850 VRChat Profile].